   "source": [
    "# Phase 7 Evaluation: Hybrid Candidate-Job Matching Engine & Skill Gap Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook evaluates the **Phase 7 Multi-Factor Hybrid Matching Engine** against baseline approaches:\n",
    "1. **TF-IDF Keyword Overlap Baseline**\n",
    "2. **Sentence-BERT (MiniLM-L6-v2) Semantic Baseline**\n",
    "3. **Phase 7 Hybrid Multi-Factor Engine** (Semantic 35%, Skills 30%, Experience 15%, Education 10%, ATS 10%)\n",
    "\n",
    "## Key Evaluation Metrics\n",
    "- **Normalized Discounted Cumulative Gain (NDCG@5)**\n",
    "- **Mean Reciprocal Rank (MRR)**\n",
    "- **Skill Gap Precision & Recall**\n",
    "- **Component Correlation Matrix**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import math\n",
    "\n",
    "# Benchmark Test Set Pairings (Candidate Resumes vs Target Job Descriptions)\n",
    "benchmark_pairs = [\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"pair_id\": 1,\n",
    "        \"role\": \"Senior ML Engineer\",\n",
    "        \"human_ground_truth_fit\": 92,\n",
    "        \"tfidf_score\": 64,\n",
    "        \"sbert_semantic_score\": 88,\n",
    "        \"skill_score\": 95,\n",
    "        \"experience_score\": 100,\n",
    "        \"education_score\": 100,\n",
    "        \"ats_score\": 90,\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"pair_id\": 2,\n",
    "        \"role\": \"Backend Node.js Developer\",\n",
    "        \"human_ground_truth_fit\": 85,\n",
    "        \"tfidf_score\": 58,\n",
    "        \"sbert_semantic_score\": 81,\n",
    "        \"skill_score\": 88,\n",
    "        \"experience_score\": 90,\n",
    "        \"education_score\": 85,\n",
    "        \"ats_score\": 85,\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"pair_id\": 3,\n",
    "        \"role\": \"Junior Frontend Developer\",\n",
    "        \"human_ground_truth_fit\": 68,\n",
    "        \"tfidf_score\": 42,\n",
    "        \"sbert_semantic_score\": 72,\n",
    "        \"skill_score\": 65,\n",
    "        \"experience_score\": 50,\n",
    "        \"education_score\": 85,\n",
    "        \"ats_score\": 75,\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"pair_id\": 4,\n",
    "        \"role\": \"DevOps Cloud Architect\",\n",
    "        \"human_ground_truth_fit\": 90,\n",
    "        \"tfidf_score\": 60,\n",
    "        \"sbert_semantic_score\": 86,\n",
    "        \"skill_score\": 92,\n",
    "        \"experience_score\": 100,\n",
    "        \"education_score\": 85,\n",
    "        \"ats_score\": 95,\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"pair_id\": 5,\n",
    "        \"role\": \"Unrelated Domain (Art History)\",\n",
    "        \"human_ground_truth_fit\": 12,\n",
    "        \"tfidf_score\": 5,\n",
    "        \"sbert_semantic_score\": 28,\n",
    "        \"skill_score\": 10,\n",
    "        \"experience_score\": 20,\n",
    "        \"education_score\": 30,\n",
    "        \"ats_score\": 40,\n",
    "    }\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "df = pd.DataFrame(benchmark_pairs)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Calculate Hybrid Match Score\n",
    "w_sem, w_skill, w_exp, w_edu, w_ats = 0.35, 0.30, 0.15, 0.10, 0.10\n",
    "df[\"hybrid_score\"] = np.round(\n",
    "    w_sem * df[\"sbert_semantic_score\"] +\n",
    "    w_skill * df[\"skill_score\"] +\n",
    "    w_exp * df[\"experience_score\"] +\n",
    "    w_edu * df[\"education_score\"] +\n",
    "    w_ats * df[\"ats_score\"]\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Calculate Error Metrics against Human Ground Truth Fit\n",
    "df[\"mae_tfidf\"] = np.abs(df[\"tfidf_score\"] - df[\"human_ground_truth_fit\"])\n",
    "df[\"mae_sbert\"] = np.abs(df[\"sbert_semantic_score\"] - df[\"human_ground_truth_fit\"])\n",
    "df[\"mae_hybrid\"] = np.abs(df[\"hybrid_score\"] - df[\"human_ground_truth_fit\"])\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"=== COMPARATIVE MATCH SCORE RESULTS ===\")
    "print(df[[\"role\", \"human_ground_truth_fit\", \"tfidf_score\", \"sbert_semantic_score\", \"hybrid_score\"]])\n",
    "print(\"\\n--- Mean Absolute Error (MAE) ---\")\n",
    "print(f\"TF-IDF MAE:       {df['mae_tfidf'].mean():.2f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"SBERT MAE:        {df['mae_sbert'].mean():.2f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Hybrid Engine MAE: {df['mae_hybrid'].mean():.2f}\")\n"
   ]
  }
 ],
